%% title: Login with OTP
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as Auth API
    participant D as Database
    U->>F: Enter phone number
    F->>A: POST /otp/request
    A->>D: Save OTP (expires in 5 min)
    A-->>U: SMS with 6-digit code
    U->>F: Enter code
    F->>A: POST /otp/verify
    A->>D: Check code + expiry
    alt Code valid
        A-->>F: JWT token
        F-->>U: Logged in
    else Wrong or expired
        A-->>F: 401 error
        F-->>U: Try again
    end
